{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。Y的音乐细节和感受层次明显不如X丰富，尤其缺少X中与具体旋律、音区、音色和音乐转折精确对应的细腻描写。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为普通观众，Y的左右分栏让我可以先扫右边的感受词，再从左边完整的话里理解人物当下的想法和行动原因，心理变化也更容易连成一条线。X的重点加亮和音乐感受的分时出现很有优势，细节尤其丰富，但话语被压缩后，一些心理转折需要观众自行补足，感受词又比较密集，容易出现意象很多、人物为什么这样却不够清楚的情况。总体而言，Y更容易让我听着音乐就读懂一个完整的人；X则更容易让我注意到音乐本身细微而具体的变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5f35c6f3-133d-48e1-9cd6-b60031737348", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T155754263000Z", "elapsed_seconds": 61.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T15:58:55.570960+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "62964b060d043bd94e0ce882efdf175d6e223324a4f829e5a78563aa27bbe343", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\